==Strategy==
The key of the stage is to kill the Bores and R.Osts quickly in order to whittle down Hannya's health before another Bore/R.Ost can spawn. Like the original stage, [[Crazed Fish Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Island Cat]] and [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] are great for the Red enemies, and [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]], if timed well, can quickly tear through R.Ost's HP.

==='''Recommended Ubers'''===
*[[Pai-Pai (Uber Rare Cat)|Pai-Pai]]: The designated "counter" to the stage. Soaks up hits like no tomorrow and can make short work of both Bore ''and'' Hannya. Immunity to Hannya's weaken means she can get right up without any real danger. Her range also allows her to act as support against R.Ost.
*[[Tecoluga (Uber Rare Cat)|Tesalan Pasalan/Lufalan Pasalan]]: A sure-fire way to get rid of a Bore or R.Ost. Sadly does not outrange Hannya but can still guarantee a quick kill on the support to give you more breathing room.
*[[Tropical Kalisa (Uber Rare Cat)|Tropical Kalisa]]: Excellent [[:Category:Nuker-class Cats|nuker]] against both Hannya and Bore who can deal major damage to them if timed correctly.
*[[EVA Unit-02 (Uber Rare Cat)|EVA Unit-02]]: Better in [[True Form]], is able to dish out [[Massive Damage|massive damage]] to Hannya and Bore while also being able to tank some hits from Hannya and can even hit Hannya from behind a Bore / R.Ost if positioned correctly.

